        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left anterior knee pain"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Ongoing for approximately 3 months; dull ache behind and around the patella, localised right behind the kneecap. Worse with stairs, especially descending, squatting, kneeling, and sitting cross-legged. Patient reports severe pain when the kneecap is pushed sideways."
      }
    },
